@_30_TranTheTruong_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress = http://localhost:5134


### Login as the default admin (stored in appsettings.json)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@FUNewsManagementSystem.org", "password": "@@abc123@@" }

### Login as a staff member (seed data: role 1)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "IsabellaDavid@FUNewsManagement.org", "password": "@1" }

### Public: active news (no token needed), with OData query options
GET {{host}}/odata/NewsArticles?$expand=Category,CreatedBy,Tags&$orderby=CreatedDate desc

### Admin: list accounts (paste the token)
GET {{host}}/odata/SystemAccounts?$filter=contains(tolower(AccountName),'emma')
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Admin: report
GET {{host}}/api/report?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
